Dialogue: 100,0:00:05.31,0:00:07.26,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 100,0:00:07.26,0:00:11.76,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Mom,0,0,0,,{\q2}Your grandfather said that \Nyou can name it, you know.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:11.76,0:00:12.65,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 100,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.54,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 100,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.14,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'll call it "Choko"!
Dialogue: 100,0:00:16.14,0:00:18.40,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Because of the cute sound it makes when it walks!
Dialogue: 100,0:00:18.40,0:00:20.29,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Dad,0,0,0,,That's a great name!
Dialogue: 100,0:00:21.86,0:00:24.12,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Mom,0,0,0,,Be sure to show it lots of love.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:24.46,0:00:25.34,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 100,0:00:49.44,0:00:50.30,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:51.61,0:00:54.31,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Grandma,0,0,0,,Thank you for always helping out, Fuuka.{TLC: are we sure she's actually cooking, or is it the grandma cooking and Fuuka just setting the table and carrying food from the kitchen etc.? -A}{I guess I'm just questioning it because Fuuka doesn't seem like someone who has cooking skills... I mean look at how useless she's been so far -A}{m - well she was helping the grandma with cooking last episode, and the grandfather's compliment seems to be directed at fuuka... but who's to say. she probably lived alone for a few years so i'd expect her to know how to cook, though that doesn't necessarily mean anything in regards to the nuance of this line}
Dialogue: 100,0:00:54.31,0:00:56.46,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.20,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Would you like some tea?
Dialogue: 100,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.59,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,I'd love some.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:03.75,0:01:07.72,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}You don't have to do all this\N just because you're staying here.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:07.72,0:01:11.21,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Seeing all of you happy makes me happy.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.60,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you don't mind.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:14.10,0:01:15.74,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:15.74,0:01:19.55,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oh yeah, I've got supplementary \Nclasses today. Head on without me.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:19.55,0:01:20.97,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:30.14,0:01:32.98,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hand it in as soon as you're done,\N and you're free to leave!
Dialogue: 100,0:01:33.74,0:01:35.08,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 100,0:01:35.08,0:01:35.73,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:35.73,0:01:37.03,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,Make sure to be here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:37.03,0:01:37.91,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 100,0:01:37.91,0:01:39.32,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 100,0:01:39.99,0:01:41.43,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,Misakino.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:41.43,0:01:41.99,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 100,0:01:42.38,0:01:44.75,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,{\q2}Is there anything other than\N that aquarium in your brain?
Dialogue: 100,0:01:44.75,0:01:46.22,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:46.22,0:01:48.47,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind,
Dialogue: 100,0:01:48.47,0:01:50.94,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,but if your attendance drops any more,
Dialogue: 100,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.19,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,you might not be able to graduate.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:53.19,0:01:57.13,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'd be happy to drop out myself,\N but Gramps insists that I at least finish high school.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:57.43,0:01:58.97,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,cc,Hey, look here.{is this some Okinawan? -A}{m - idk. could be a slurred あのさぁ. iirc what cr had wasn't substantially different so}
Dialogue: 100,0:01:58.97,0:02:03.71,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,{\q2}I've been looking the other way since\N I thought you'd be inheriting the aquarium,
Dialogue: 100,0:02:03.71,0:02:06.05,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,but it might be closing down, right?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:06.05,0:02:07.49,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Who told you that?!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:07.49,0:02:09.48,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,Just a rumor that's going around.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.02,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,You're acting as the director now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:12.55,0:02:14.22,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,cc,C'mon, you're a high-schooler.{"assa"? like "anta (sa)"? Okinawan again? -A}{m - ハッサ is apparently an okinawan word fwiw - http://churaneko.com/okinawahougen/word/ID03699.html}
Dialogue: 100,0:02:14.22,0:02:15.73,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,Don't get in over your head.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:15.73,0:02:19.99,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,If no one else will do it, what choice do I have?!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:21.31,0:02:22.75,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:25.94,0:02:30.91,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Sensei,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, it's good to have something \Nyou can get so invested in.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:34.10,0:02:35.67,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,Misakino!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:36.05,0:02:37.60,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,Aquarium duty again today?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:37.60,0:02:38.34,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:38.34,0:02:39.87,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I was just heading there.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:39.87,0:02:41.80,1$GJM_Main_1080p,B,0,0,0,,You're a hard worker! Very admirable!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:41.80,0:02:42.97,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:43.35,0:02:45.96,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,If you want to root for me, then come visit!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:45.96,0:02:48.56,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}We'll be holding all kinds \Nof events over the summer.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:49.09,0:02:50.17,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:50.17,0:02:51.76,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,I'll go there on my next date.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:51.76,0:02:52.23,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:52.74,0:02:53.78,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,When did you get a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:53.78,0:02:56.18,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,I'm getting one this summer, for sure!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:57.38,0:02:58.57,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:58.57,0:03:00.37,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 100,0:03:06.98,0:03:10.05,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,Kuuya, take care of the rest, will ya?
Dialogue: 100,0:03:10.05,0:03:12.44,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you leaving already?
Dialogue: 100,0:03:12.44,0:03:12.98,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:12.98,0:03:14.81,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,I'm off to Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.59,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,I'll be back late.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:17.81,0:03:20.25,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Is it looking like anyone will take them in?
Dialogue: 100,0:03:20.25,0:03:22.84,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,Still only 'bout half of them, maybe.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.39,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 100,0:03:24.39,0:03:25.50,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:25.50,0:03:28.47,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,{\q2}We'll make sure you staff\N have some place to go, too.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:28.87,0:03:34.27,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,{\q2}But... I'm basically a stray\N that you took in and cared for.{is the missing space intentional? -A}{also, consider changing this line to him comparing himself to an abandoned kitten/puppy maybe? that's the vibe I'm getting from the Japanese line ("I'm basically like an abandoned kitten/puppy you took in" or something) -A}
Dialogue: 100,0:03:34.27,0:03:37.73,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,{\q2}I haven't really given much\N thought to what comes after.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:48.13,0:03:49.85,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 100,0:03:58.29,0:04:00.33,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,These are so cute.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:02.01,0:04:04.35,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,"First penguin"?
Dialogue: 100,0:04:04.35,0:04:07.76,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Oh, the acting director designed those.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:08.11,0:04:09.89,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,They aren't selling very well.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:11.62,0:04:15.81,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,{\q2}We're selling lots of postcards,\N so make sure to refill the shelves.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:15.81,0:04:17.25,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:17.25,0:04:18.40,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Whew...
Dialogue: 100,0:04:21.53,0:04:26.66,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,{\q2\i1}The first penguin courageously takes on\N any challenge that comes their way.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:27.13,0:04:31.83,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}They're the first to jump into the water,\N even in the face of possible danger.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:32.79,0:04:34.67,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,Haven't been here in forever.{is this not grammatically correct or am I just stupid? haven't been *here* in forever? -A}
Dialogue: 100,0:04:34.67,0:04:35.92,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Kai!
Dialogue: 100,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.43,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 100,0:04:37.92,0:04:40.30,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Well, I'm here as promised.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.38,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Man,
Dialogue: 100,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.63,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to have another guy on the team.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:45.14,0:04:46.99,1$GJM_Overlap_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you so much, Kai!
Dialogue: 100,0:04:45.45,0:04:48.02,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I've never seen him smile like that before.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:48.02,0:04:49.39,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,He's just bad with girls.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:49.39,0:04:51.77,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,He doesn't mean anything by it.{but don't let that stop you, all fujoshis out there}
Dialogue: 100,0:04:52.56,0:04:54.29,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,I'm Nakamura Kai.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.77,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,I'll be working here starting today.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:55.77,0:04:56.98,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.39,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Kai, could you help Kuuya with his work?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:00.39,0:05:02.82,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Fuuka, you'll be weighing the penguins with me.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:03.09,0:05:04.72,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:10.13,0:05:11.46,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Penguins...
Dialogue: 100,0:05:15.25,0:05:19.10,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,You weigh them one by one like this.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:19.10,0:05:20.92,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I generally start with Choko.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:22.27,0:05:25.32,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,We usually do regular medical examinations too,
Dialogue: 100,0:05:25.32,0:05:28.39,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}but Dr. Takeshita, the veterinarian,\Nis on maternity leave.{dr? mrs? don't forget to change other uses of the name if you add a title}{Checked with a vet tech friend, and they do use Dr. I'm not sure how I feel about its readability though... Thoughts, QCs? - Lann}
Dialogue: 100,0:05:28.86,0:05:30.75,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Um, Kuku—
Dialogue: 100,0:05:30.75,0:05:31.89,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Director Kukuru?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:31.89,0:05:34.23,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I told you, just call me Kukuru.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:34.23,0:05:37.60,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,But "director" seems more appropriate at work.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:37.93,0:05:39.42,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:39.42,0:05:42.73,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,What's the best way to tell the penguins apart?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:42.73,0:05:45.50,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,You can check the tags on their flippers,
Dialogue: 100,0:05:45.50,0:05:48.11,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}but the more time you spend with them, \Nthe easier it'll be.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:49.11,0:05:51.91,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Choko is really affectionate.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:51.91,0:05:55.71,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}He's been here for almost fifteen years,\N and is used to caretakers.{m - it feels kind of weird to use gender neutral pronouns when kukuru presumably knows what sex choko is... but *we* don't so idk what we can do to not make it awkward}{Taking the gamble. - Lann}
Dialogue: 100,0:05:55.71,0:05:58.58,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, during the feeding...
Dialogue: 100,0:06:02.15,0:06:04.80,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I remember seeing little Choko at the very front.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.38,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I'll take it slow this time...
Dialogue: 100,0:06:12.58,0:06:14.35,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'd call that a successful feeding!
Dialogue: 100,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.45,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,What a relief...
Dialogue: 100,0:06:16.45,0:06:18.46,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Choko's quite the glutton.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.92,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:19.92,0:06:20.89,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:20.89,0:06:25.57,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}Caretakers need to be able to immediately tell\N how much food the penguins eat,
Dialogue: 100,0:06:25.57,0:06:27.95,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and adjust the amount they get as needed.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:28.59,0:06:33.61,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}More for lightweight ones,\N and less for the heavier ones.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:33.61,0:06:35.45,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,That's why we weigh them.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:35.45,0:06:36.64,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 100,0:06:37.96,0:06:40.83,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Eat up, Choko.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:42.38,0:06:43.23,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:43.23,0:06:45.34,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Something seems off.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:45.34,0:06:46.60,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Choko?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:46.60,0:06:47.99,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Off how?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:50.74,0:06:52.22,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 100,0:06:52.58,0:06:54.48,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bumblefoot?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.47,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's common with penguins.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:56.47,0:07:00.80,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}It's similar to corns, but if left unchecked, \Nit can get infected,
Dialogue: 100,0:07:00.80,0:07:02.22,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\an8}so we can't ignore it.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:02.22,0:07:06.61,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,{\q2}Penguins often become inactive\N at aquariums if you leave them alone,
Dialogue: 100,0:07:06.93,0:07:09.52,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,which makes it more common.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.11,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,We do take them on regular walks to prevent it...
Dialogue: 100,0:07:12.11,0:07:15.99,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Well, I'd just ask the director once he's back.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:16.69,0:07:19.50,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm not sure we can afford to wait.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:19.50,0:07:22.87,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,{\q2}C'mon, this is something for someone\N with more experience.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.85,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm the director here!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.69,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'll ask Dr. Takeshita.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:28.69,0:07:30.42,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,The one on maternity leave?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:30.42,0:07:33.70,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,{\q2}Are you kidding?\N Reporting to the director comes first.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.49,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm just giving her a call!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:42.69,0:07:44.20,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.08,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:45.08,0:07:46.63,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,I'll swing by.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:46.63,0:07:47.94,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,The sooner the better, right?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.79,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Thank you so much! That's a huge help!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:50.79,0:07:51.60,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:51.60,0:07:52.45,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Yes!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:54.94,0:07:57.12,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 100,0:07:57.12,0:08:01.01,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,The director asked me to help out here.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:01.01,0:08:03.89,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, I haven't started on\N that one yet. Do you mind?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:03.89,0:08:04.88,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,On it.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.45,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Oh, allow me.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.77,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.95,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,You really have that "man of the sea" vibe.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:23.95,0:08:25.63,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.52,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,You're a bit different from Kuuya.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:30.06,0:08:31.24,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure!
Dialogue: 100,0:08:35.89,0:08:37.25,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:37.77,0:08:39.08,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:39.37,0:08:40.64,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Kukuru.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.04,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,You're staying at her place, right?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:42.04,0:08:42.89,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:42.89,0:08:44.58,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,They've been very kind to me.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:44.90,0:08:47.95,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,She's a bit of an eccentric, you know?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:48.45,0:08:52.41,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,{\q2}She's obsessed with this place,\N and always goes on about fish.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:52.41,0:08:53.55,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:55.47,0:08:58.68,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Kukuru lost her parents when she was young.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:01.33,0:09:05.53,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,{\q2}She said they often brought her\N to visit Gama Gama Aquarium.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:06.24,0:09:08.81,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's probably why this place \Nmeans so much to her.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:10.02,0:09:14.66,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,{\q2}After her grandparents took her in,\N she started helping out at the aquarium.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:14.66,0:09:19.19,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,I guess it's like the animals here became her family.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:20.25,0:09:23.83,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,{\q2}She took up the role of summer \Ndirector to protect the place.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:24.76,0:09:27.35,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,I think she's shouldering too much all alone.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:29.45,0:09:34.31,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,So I'd be happy if you could help her out.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:34.31,0:09:36.47,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can too.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.68,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Like with manual labor.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.59,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:40.73,0:09:42.04,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,You're kind, aren't you?
Dialogue: 100,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.16,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Nah, I've just sort of been stuck with her.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.60,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.35,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,I can't believe them!
Dialogue: 100,0:09:49.21,0:09:52.61,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,{\q2}No matter how many times I apply\N for continued funding for Gama Gama,
Dialogue: 100,0:09:52.61,0:09:55.04,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,they won't listen to a word I say!
Dialogue: 100,0:09:55.04,0:09:57.74,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Tsukimi,0,0,0,,Well, what do you expect from bureaucrats?
Dialogue: 100,0:09:57.74,0:10:02.49,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,{\q2}And then they have the damn nerve to say that\N it's ridiculous to have a high-schooler as director!
Dialogue: 100,0:10:02.84,0:10:05.40,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Tsukimi,0,0,0,,Hey there, watch your tone.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:07.01,0:10:09.09,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Tsukimi,0,0,0,,But I'm amazed you'd do that much.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.43,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Tsukimi,0,0,0,,You really are nice, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:16.13,0:10:20.98,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,I just don't want to see Gama Gama go.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:20.98,0:10:25.02,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,{\q2}I've been going there ever since I was a kid,\N and it's important to the area as...
Dialogue: 100,0:10:25.55,0:10:27.93,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,I can't really put it into words...
Dialogue: 100,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.65,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Tsukimi,0,0,0,,I think I get it.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:29.65,0:10:32.97,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,And I just feel like I have to do something.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:32.97,0:10:35.23,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,I don't want all of Kukuru's efforts to go to waste.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:36.81,0:10:40.57,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Tsukimi,0,0,0,,And here's a little something for all {\i1}your{\i0} efforts!
Dialogue: 100,0:10:41.05,0:10:43.66,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,Thank you, Udon!
Dialogue: 100,0:10:47.27,0:10:49.29,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Dr. Takeshita!
Dialogue: 100,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.90,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Sorry, it took longer than I expected.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:51.90,0:10:54.39,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,The traffic was really bad.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:54.39,0:10:57.33,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Wow, he's sure grown.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:57.33,0:11:01.85,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\q2}He's already past the due date, \Nbut it seems he's a bit shy.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:01.85,0:11:05.34,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for asking you to come all this way.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:05.34,0:11:06.18,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:06.49,0:11:10.42,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,The doctor says it's good to get some exercise.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:14.31,0:11:16.29,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,It looks like you were right.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:16.29,0:11:18.07,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,It's the early stages of bumblefoot.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.99,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I thought so...
Dialogue: 100,0:11:19.99,0:11:22.42,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Let's use some wound dressing.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:22.42,0:11:25.57,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\q2}We'll protect the affected area \Nso it doesn't get wet or dirty,
Dialogue: 100,0:11:25.57,0:11:28.88,1$GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}then quarantine and observe \Nthem somewhere without water.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:29.69,0:11:32.13,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,That's the best we can do right now.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:32.13,0:11:33.58,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:37.94,0:11:43.08,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't suppose you would be willing to examine\N the other penguins while you're at it?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.82,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:44.82,0:11:47.10,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,I might as well now that I'm here.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:47.10,0:11:49.13,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 100,0:11:49.13,0:11:52.45,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,But are you sure you'll be all right?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:53.05,0:11:54.40,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Yeah, no worries.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:59.57,0:12:01.26,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 100,0:12:02.03,0:12:03.83,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,It hurts a little.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:13.48,0:12:15.50,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:16.62,0:12:18.44,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,I think my water broke.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:19.33,0:12:20.81,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:20.81,0:12:22.36,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:23.24,0:12:24.64,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:24.64,0:12:26.81,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Could you call for a taxi?
Dialogue: 100,0:12:26.81,0:12:28.73,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Also, I need my handbag.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:28.73,0:12:30.38,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,O-On it!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:34.03,0:12:36.37,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Hey! No running indoors!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:36.37,0:12:37.50,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,It's a baby!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.84,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,The spottedfin puller?
Dialogue: 100,0:12:38.84,0:12:39.48,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,The bag!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.66,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Dr. Takeshita's handbag!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:41.66,0:12:44.16,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Acting Director?
Dialogue: 100,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.20,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to keep a level head.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:52.52,0:12:55.32,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Kuuya, go get Kai and Fuuka!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:55.32,0:12:57.70,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Dr. Takeshita's water broke!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:57.70,0:12:58.76,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:58.76,0:12:59.34,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 100,0:12:59.89,0:13:00.57,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,what?
Dialogue: 100,0:13:09.80,0:13:11.40,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 100,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.39,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'll leave your handbag here.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:13.39,0:13:14.56,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.00,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 100,0:13:16.00,0:13:17.44,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I brought towels!
Dialogue: 100,0:13:17.44,0:13:18.44,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.62,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Doesn't the aquarium have any cars?
Dialogue: 100,0:13:22.62,0:13:25.03,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,We do, but none of us have our licenses.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:25.03,0:13:26.78,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,I'll keep a lookout for the taxi.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:31.52,0:13:35.51,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm sorry, but we'll be using \Nthis area for a little while.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:41.03,0:13:43.38,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Hello, it's Takeshita.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:43.38,0:13:45.88,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,My water broke on a business trip.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:46.75,0:13:49.95,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}Kai, put up a sign outside \Nsaying we're temporarily closed.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:49.95,0:13:53.45,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Give the visitors leaving free postcards!
Dialogue: 100,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.77,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 100,0:13:58.27,0:14:00.15,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Doctor.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.32,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:02.32,0:14:05.40,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,I never saw this coming.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:05.40,0:14:09.37,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Do you remember what you told me once?
Dialogue: 100,0:14:09.86,0:14:13.62,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}How the aquarium is responsible\N for the lives of its animals?{ugh this doesn't really work well with how we phrased it last ep}{I think it's okay?}{looks fine -A}
Dialogue: 100,0:14:14.59,0:14:20.38,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\q2}Don't forget that the animals \Nare entrusting you with their lives.{ep 2 10:44}
Dialogue: 100,0:14:20.77,0:14:22.67,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do everything you can to protect them.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:25.20,0:14:28.48,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}The aquarium isn't just\N responsible for the lives of fish,
Dialogue: 100,0:14:28.48,0:14:32.01,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,but the lives of its visitors and staff too.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:32.51,0:14:36.27,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,So we'll do everything we can to protect you!
Dialogue: 100,0:14:38.06,0:14:41.63,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Responsible... for lives...
Dialogue: 100,0:14:53.77,0:14:55.25,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,No taxis are available.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:55.25,0:14:56.85,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,It'll be at least an hour...
Dialogue: 100,0:15:59.18,0:16:01.19,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Is the car here yet?
Dialogue: 100,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.94,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,The car's here!
Dialogue: 100,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.32,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 100,0:16:12.89,0:16:14.20,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 100,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.94,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,We couldn't get a taxi, so I asked a friend instead!
Dialogue: 100,0:16:17.94,0:16:19.33,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,You're a real slave driver.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.46,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,We're busy at the tourism association, you know.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:23.89,0:16:25.90,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,Where should I take you?
Dialogue: 100,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.90,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Do you know where Uchima Maternity Hospital is?
Dialogue: 100,0:16:28.71,0:16:29.34,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.28,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'll go with you!
Dialogue: 100,0:16:31.28,0:16:34.17,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Wait, I'll accompany her instead.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:34.17,0:16:36.20,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,You should stay behind.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:36.20,0:16:37.10,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 100,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.60,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,You need to look after Choko.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.18,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:44.30,0:16:45.67,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.33,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kuuya,0,0,0,,God, that was nerve-racking.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:51.33,0:16:53.24,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,I was so scared.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.16,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Another road closure?
Dialogue: 100,0:17:03.16,0:17:06.65,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,Apparently they found an unexploded bomb nearby.{wow can you imagine this being a part of daily life}{the one time Shane visited me in Poland, we got stuck on a train from the Warsaw airport to Gdansk because they found something unexploded from WW2 near the train tracks and stopped all trains while they removed it, so I can assure you this actually happens}{m - that's terrifying. also, i'm thinking, is "bomb" right? maybe it's a mine or something, idk what kind of stuff would be lying around on okinawa... apparently the proper term is "unexploded ordnance", but i sure wouldn't know what that is}
Dialogue: 100,0:17:06.65,0:17:07.96,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:12.11,0:17:14.85,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's time for this local expert\N to show you what she can do.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:14.85,0:17:18.14,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,{\q2}I drive all over the place every day,\N so a detour is no challenge.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:21.69,0:17:25.02,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,{\q2}Drive as carefully as you can\N so the car doesn't shake.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.53,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,But drive quickly!
Dialogue: 100,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.52,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Karin,0,0,0,,Now that's a tall order.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:40.10,0:17:41.03,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 100,0:17:41.59,0:17:45.54,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Choko's been eating less lately.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:45.54,0:17:49.17,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}I know it's probably old age,\N so there's nothing I can do, but still...
Dialogue: 100,0:17:49.65,0:17:51.55,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kai,0,0,0,,It's just one thing after the other.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:52.19,0:17:54.10,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,That's the line of work we're in.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:54.94,0:17:56.91,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Get well soon, okay?
Dialogue: 100,0:18:00.08,0:18:02.68,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I hope Dr. Takeshita is all right.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:04.71,0:18:06.82,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Would you like some water?
Dialogue: 100,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.81,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,I'm fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:08.81,0:18:12.55,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\q2}Sorry for making you do this.\N My husband should be here soon.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:17.81,0:18:21.74,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,I had a strange dream back at the aquarium.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:23.36,0:18:25.92,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,It was like I was underwater,
Dialogue: 100,0:18:25.92,0:18:28.36,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,and the fish were swimming all around me.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:29.33,0:18:32.91,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Among them, I met my boy.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:33.85,0:18:38.69,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,He told me that we'd get to see each other soon.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:40.53,0:18:42.27,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,I have to get through this.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:45.39,0:18:47.48,1$GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,It's time to move rooms.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:52.28,0:18:55.11,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,{\i1}Makutu sookee, nankuru nai sa!
Dialogue: 100,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.99,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,And why didn't you call me?
Dialogue: 100,0:18:59.27,0:19:03.33,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,You should have asked me first.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:03.33,0:19:07.11,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,{\q2}Then you wouldn't have had \Nto put Dr. Takeshita in danger.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:07.11,0:19:07.87,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 100,0:19:07.87,0:19:09.89,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,No buts.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:09.89,0:19:14.36,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,{\q2}Being the director doesn't mean\N you should try to do it all by yourself.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:14.36,0:19:15.77,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.39,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:23.11,0:19:23.81,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:24.48,0:19:25.18,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:25.96,0:19:26.64,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:27.27,0:19:28.64,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,The delivery went well!{lit. "the baby was just born"}
Dialogue: 100,0:19:29.52,0:19:31.90,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,The mother and baby are both in good health!
Dialogue: 100,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.05,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Gramps,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 100,0:19:33.11,0:19:36.23,1$GJM_Overlap_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 100,0:19:34.05,0:19:36.23,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Grandma,0,0,0,,I was so worried.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:43.49,0:19:45.35,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,He's so cute.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:45.35,0:19:47.29,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Is he sleeping?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:47.29,0:19:49.31,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,He still hasn't opened his eyes.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:49.31,0:19:51.16,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:51.16,0:19:54.04,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for everything.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:54.41,0:19:56.80,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I got told off by Gramps afterward.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:57.29,0:19:59.43,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't beat yourself up.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:00.81,0:20:06.05,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\q2}It turned into a very memorable \Nbirth thanks to you two.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:13.66,0:20:15.07,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,What a cutie.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:15.83,0:20:18.14,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Mothers are amazing, aren't they?
Dialogue: 100,0:20:19.28,0:20:20.66,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:20.66,0:20:22.03,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,You might be right.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:23.01,0:20:28.28,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\q2}But not as amazing as this little one,\N who worked the hardest to be born healthy.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:28.28,0:20:30.04,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:50.41,0:20:51.98,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Um, Dr. Takeshita...
Dialogue: 100,0:20:52.35,0:20:53.57,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 100,0:20:53.57,0:20:56.71,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,How do you get a maternity record?
Dialogue: 100,0:20:57.70,0:20:58.73,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Are you pregnant?!
Dialogue: 100,0:20:58.73,0:21:00.48,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,O-Of course not!
Dialogue: 100,0:21:02.70,0:21:07.31,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Takeshita,0,0,0,,{\q2}You get it from the local government \Nwhen you become pregnant.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:07.84,0:21:09.03,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:23.76,0:21:25.21,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 100,0:21:26.61,0:21:28.51,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Oh. Well...
Dialogue: 100,0:21:29.13,0:21:31.44,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I thought I'd contribute to sales, or something.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:31.44,0:21:33.77,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,I ended up becoming really fond of it.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:34.65,0:21:40.27,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}I want to have the courage \Nto do something new one day too.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:41.01,0:21:43.41,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,That's what I was thinking as I designed it.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:44.92,0:21:47.09,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you like it!
Dialogue: 100,0:21:48.40,0:21:49.85,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,We gotta get back to Gama Gama!
Dialogue: 100,0:21:49.85,0:21:51.71,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Lunch break is almost over!
Dialogue: 100,0:21:55.33,0:21:56.47,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:56.47,0:21:57.50,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:58.61,0:22:02.56,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Kukuru,0,0,0,,{\q2}Having courage isn't the same\N as just being reckless, right?
Dialogue: 100,0:22:02.56,0:22:03.26,1$GJM_Main_1080p,Fuuka,0,0,0,,Huh?
