Comment: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.87,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Shards of my dreams
Comment: 0,0:22:21.87,0:22:24.58,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Stabbing into my hands
Comment: 0,0:22:24.58,0:22:29.67,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,No matter how I struggle, they just burrow deeper in
Comment: 0,0:22:29.67,0:22:31.42,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,What if my touch
Comment: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:34.13,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Wounded somebody else
Comment: 0,0:22:34.13,0:22:37.76,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,I wonder if I could forgive myself
Comment: 0,0:22:38.05,0:22:41.35,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,What's between the blue above
Comment: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:43.72,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,And blue down below?
Comment: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:47.31,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Such a fragile line out of reach
Comment: 0,0:22:47.31,0:22:50.98,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,I feel it when I close my eyes
Comment: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:52.73,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,And hear there's a voice
Comment: 0,0:22:52.73,0:22:59.95,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,That mirrors all my colors back at me
Comment: 0,0:22:59.95,0:23:02.32,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,The gentle wandering waves
Comment: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:07.50,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Waver and ripple as the sea pursues a bright moon
Comment: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:09.58,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,(Slowly turning)
Comment: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:11.79,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,But as the light wanes away
Comment: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:17.59,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,The pain I thought would always be with me will fade too
Comment: 0,0:23:17.59,0:23:20.09,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,And so be it
Comment: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:20.93,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Guided
Comment: 0,0:23:20.93,0:23:22.18,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,By starlight
Comment: 0,0:23:22.18,0:23:23.39,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Descending
Comment: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:25.68,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Deeper into the water
Comment: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:28.14,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Where I had been drifting
Comment: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:31.02,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,Through days rolling in and out
Comment: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:37.19,2$ED,,0,0,0,kara,My soul can begin to swim
